sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Directional Audio
    
    actor Blind User
    participant AI as Object Detection
    participant Logic as Audio Spatializer
    participant Speaker as Headphones

    AI->>Logic: Object: "Door", BoundingBox: [Left: 10, Right: 50]
    
    activate Logic
    Logic->>Logic: Calculate Center X (Left side of screen)
    Logic->>Logic: Map X to Stereo Pan (-0.8 Left)
    Logic-->>Speaker: Play "Door" (Pan: Left)
    deactivate Logic
    
    Speaker->>Blind User:  "Door" (Heard in Left Ear)
